Written by crosslink-ansible on {{ ansible_date_time.iso8601 }} from what this host reported. Rewritten on every run; do not edit by hand. Nothing secret is in this file. The full card, with the seed's phrase, is in the key bundle on the control machine.

## Files on this host

| path | what it is |
|---|---|
| `{{ crosslink_config_dir }}/zebrad.toml` | the node's config. Managed by Ansible |
| `{{ crosslink_config_dir }}/README.md` | this file |
| `/etc/systemd/system/{{ crosslink_service_name }}.service` | the node's unit |
| `{{ crosslink_home }}/bin/zebrad` | the active binary, a link to `{{ crosslink_binary | default('zebrad') }}` |
| `{{ crosslink_home }}/bin/` | one binary per commit. Older ones stay for rollback |
| `{{ crosslink_home }}/chain-params.py` | reads this build's own chain parameters into the config on every deploy |
{% if zebrad_install_mode == 'build' %}
| `{{ crosslink_home }}/src/` | the source checkout, owned by `{{ crosslink_user }}` |
| `{{ crosslink_home }}/.cargo/` | the Rust toolchain that built it |
{% endif %}
| `{{ crosslink_data_dir }}/` | chain state and the BFT store. Resyncs from the network |
| `{{ node_seed_path }}` | the seed, 32 bytes: this node's BFT identity and wallet seed{{ ', and the key to its mining rewards' if (crosslink_mining_enabled | bool and not crosslink_miner_address) else '' }}. **Private.** zebrad replaces a missing one at random |
| `{{ crosslink_config_dir }}/chain.env` | the chain's calendar (period, Staking Day, first staking block, finality start), for the two scripts below |
| `/usr/local/bin/crosslink-check` | one screen on this host's health. Changes nothing |
{% if not crosslink_disable_wallet | bool %}
| `/usr/local/bin/crosslink-stake` | stakes this host's rewards. {{ ('Its timer runs it every ' ~ crosslink_autostake_every_minutes ~ ' minutes' ~ (', as a dry run that sends nothing' if crosslink_autostake_dry_run | bool else '') ~ ': `crosslink-stake --timer status`') if crosslink_autostake_to else 'Run by hand' }}; the playbook never runs it |
| `/var/lib/crosslink-stake/` | the replies to `crosslink-stake`, with the bond keys, and its ledger. **Private.** Copy it to the key bundle |
{% endif %}

Seed fingerprint (sha256 prefix): `{{ node_seed_fingerprint_host | default('not yet', true) }}`. Safe to share. The key bundle's copy must show the same.

The seed's directory is named by the release for the season (`zebrad/src/config.rs`). A release that renames it starts the node with a fresh seed, a new identity and a new wallet. Before upgrading, read the name in the new release and copy the seed there first.
