Stake goes to the finalizer address. It is public, and the node logs it at every start:

```bash
journalctl -u {{ crosslink_service_name }} | grep -m1 'finalizer address:'
```

A seat appears once stake points here and this node is among the largest finalizers: the active roster is capped, and a finalizer outside it signs nothing.
